before:
Filter ((x#2 Gt 1) And (b#1 Gt 2))
  Project x#2:int64! := a#0, b#1:int64! := b#1
    Scan model t [a#0:int64!, b#1:int64!]
after:
Project x#2:int64! := a#0, b#1:int64! := b#1
  Filter (a#0 Gt 1) AND (b#1 Gt 2)
    Scan model t [a#0:int64!, b#1:int64!]
